<%- include('partials/header', { title }) %>
<section class="admin-page"><div class="container"><a class="back-link" href="/admin/products">← Kembali ke katalog admin</a><div class="admin-form-heading"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> JOY GALERY / PRODUCT EDITOR</p><h1><%= product ? 'Edit this' : 'Add something' %> <em><%= product ? 'goodie.' : 'lovely.' %></em></h1><p class="admin-subtitle">Perubahan yang disimpan akan langsung memengaruhi katalog publik. Harga menggunakan rupiah tanpa tanda pemisah.</p></div><div class="editor-layout"><form class="editor-form" action="<%= formAction %>" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><div class="editor-form-section"><p class="eyebrow">01 — PRODUCT INFORMATION</p><label>Nama produk <span>*</span><input type="text" name="name" maxlength="120" value="<%= product ? product.name : '' %>" placeholder="Contoh: Pastel Canva Kit" required></label><div class="form-row"><label>Kategori <span>*</span><input type="text" name="category" maxlength="80" value="<%= product ? product.category : 'Template Canva' %>" placeholder="Template Canva / Moodboard / Wording" required></label><label>Harga (IDR) <span>*</span><input type="number" name="price" min="0" max="1000000000" step="1" value="<%= product ? product.price : '' %>" placeholder="25000" required></label></div><label>Deskripsi produk <span>*</span><textarea name="description" rows="5" maxlength="2000" placeholder="Ceritakan isi dan manfaat produk digital ini..." required><%= product ? product.description : '' %></textarea></label><label>Label kecil <small>(opsional, mis. BEST SELLER / NEW)</small><input type="text" name="badge" maxlength="30" value="<%= product ? product.badge : '' %>" placeholder="NEW"></label></div><div class="editor-form-section"><p class="eyebrow">02 — PRODUCT IMAGE</p><div class="image-editor-preview"><img id="image-preview" src="<%= product ? product.image : '/images/products/template-canva.svg' %>" alt="Preview foto produk"><div><b>Foto sampul produk</b><small>Format JPG, PNG, WEBP atau GIF. Maksimal 6 MB. Foto baru menggantikan foto saat ini.</small><label class="file-picker" for="product-image">Pilih gambar ↗</label><input class="visually-hidden" id="product-image" type="file" name="image" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp,image/gif" data-image-preview="image-preview"></div></div></div><div class="editor-form-section settings-section"><p class="eyebrow">03 — VISIBILITY & DISPLAY</p><label class="check-row"><input type="checkbox" name="featured" <%= product && product.featured ? 'checked' : '' %>><span><b>Tampilkan sebagai featured</b><small>Produk muncul lebih awal di katalog.</small></span></label><label class="check-row"><input type="checkbox" name="active" <%= !product || product.active ? 'checked' : '' %>><span><b>Aktifkan di katalog</b><small>Matikan untuk menyembunyikan produk tanpa menghapusnya.</small></span></label></div><div class="editor-form-actions"><a class="button button-outline" href="/admin/products">Batal</a><button class="button button-dark" type="submit">Simpan produk <span>↗</span></button></div></form><aside class="editor-side-note"><span class="note-star">✳</span><h3>A tiny reminder.</h3><p>Gunakan gambar yang kamu punya hak untuk menjualnya. Tulis deskripsi dengan jelas, lalu pastikan harga sesuai sebelum menayangkan produk.</p><div class="editor-side-line"></div><span class="eyebrow">JOYGALERY / STUDIO NOTES</span></aside></div></div></section>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
